WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:04.150
Ranking Tournament Qualifying Round

00:14.110 --> 00:15.610
Wind Strike!

01:03.800 --> 01:06.710
<i>The real game begins now.</i>

01:18.560 --> 01:21.600
You've succeeded with flying colors, Desir.

01:22.080 --> 01:26.150
But now, they're totally 
going to come after you.

01:49.840 --> 01:57.010
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

01:59.380 --> 02:06.160
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

02:06.160 --> 02:08.730
<i>A stolen smile</i>

02:08.730 --> 02:18.110
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

02:18.110 --> 02:22.740
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

02:22.740 --> 02:27.160
<i>For the final challenge</i>

02:27.160 --> 02:30.590
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

02:30.590 --> 02:36.790
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

02:36.790 --> 02:40.130
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

02:40.130 --> 02:47.180
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

02:47.180 --> 02:49.510
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

02:49.510 --> 02:52.150
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

02:52.150 --> 02:56.990
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

02:56.990 --> 02:59.320
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

02:59.320 --> 03:01.950
<i>To my own story</i>

03:06.210 --> 03:11.250
<b></b>Episode 6

03:06.210 --> 03:11.250
<b> Final Round</b>

03:08.580 --> 03:11.250
What the hell is this article?!

03:11.840 --> 03:17.600
"Beta class to rank within 30th place. 
Will they be the first ever promoted to alpha?"

03:18.020 --> 03:19.640
Give me a break.

03:19.640 --> 03:23.270
We can't have them put a stain 
on our sacred alpha class!

03:29.460 --> 03:32.610
I apologize for my disgraceful conduct,

03:32.610 --> 03:35.360
but I hope you understand my rage.

03:36.020 --> 03:39.760
You've been chosen to be 
a part of the glorious Blue Moon.

03:39.760 --> 03:43.410
You might only be first-years, 
but you have the responsibility

03:43.410 --> 03:46.210
of protecting and upholding 
its pride and tradition.

03:46.870 --> 03:48.420
In the final round of the tournament,

03:48.420 --> 03:52.750
you must use any means 
necessary to eliminate them.

03:53.240 --> 03:57.310
They must never be single rankers.

03:57.310 --> 03:58.480
You hear me?!

03:59.070 --> 04:00.890
Azest Kingscrown.

04:00.890 --> 04:01.890
Yes, sir.

04:02.720 --> 04:06.530
You've fought against Desir Herrman.

04:06.530 --> 04:07.640
I have.

04:08.020 --> 04:09.400
Can you beat him?

04:09.940 --> 04:11.400
The odds are in my favor.

04:11.400 --> 04:13.150
So you can win?

04:13.550 --> 04:14.570
Yes, sir.

04:19.220 --> 04:20.450
Very good.

04:21.580 --> 04:25.170
You are the leader 
of the first-years in Blue Moon.

04:25.170 --> 04:27.950
Be sure to bring us victory.

04:28.290 --> 04:29.290
Yes, sir.

04:31.350 --> 04:32.950
<i>Desir Herrman.</i>

04:32.950 --> 04:37.460
<i>Ever since that day, 
I've never forgotten about you.</i>

04:39.200 --> 04:42.990
<i>The one who gave me a taste of defeat...</i>

04:45.100 --> 04:48.720
<i>This time, I'll beat you 
with everything I've got.</i>

05:01.510 --> 05:03.120
May we have a word?

05:08.400 --> 05:11.830
Doneta Hadoon and Percival Asengunitz.

05:13.090 --> 05:16.190
Do you object to me being the leader?

05:18.980 --> 05:21.350
I know how strong you are.

05:21.350 --> 05:22.840
That's not what we want to discuss.

05:23.820 --> 05:25.100
What then?

05:25.830 --> 05:29.310
Can I be the one to take down Romantica Eru?

05:30.500 --> 05:32.630
I'll take on Pram Schnaizer.

05:34.520 --> 05:37.380
We have a better chance of winning 
if we fight as a party.

05:37.730 --> 05:39.190
We know.

05:39.190 --> 05:41.500
Shall we say it's for personal reasons?

05:42.810 --> 05:45.290
I want to crush her with my own hands.

05:50.750 --> 05:52.320
Very well.

05:52.320 --> 05:53.570
Suit yourselves.

05:54.680 --> 05:56.350
You're reasonable.

05:59.080 --> 06:01.510
I do have one order as your leader.

06:03.330 --> 06:05.670
Desir Herrman is off-limits.

06:07.270 --> 06:10.670
I will be the one to defeat him.

06:13.990 --> 06:16.380
They both have enough skills.

06:16.380 --> 06:18.480
Maybe they're ready for the next step.

06:19.420 --> 06:22.240
One, two, three, four.

06:22.590 --> 06:25.480
Five, six, seven...

06:25.480 --> 06:27.740
Oh, Desir!

06:27.740 --> 06:29.160
You're here early.

06:30.040 --> 06:32.100
At last, it's the final round!

06:32.100 --> 06:34.220
So, what kind of training are we going to do?

06:34.220 --> 06:35.530
We're not doing any training.

06:36.690 --> 06:37.530
Huh?!

06:38.860 --> 06:42.050
We're doing a special regimen
 for the final round.

06:50.800 --> 06:52.290
That should do it.

06:53.990 --> 06:59.050
"Chronology of Events," 
"Structure of Privius Clock Tower,"

06:59.050 --> 07:02.290
and "History of 1218"?

07:02.700 --> 07:05.150
They're all history books.

07:05.150 --> 07:06.240
Yes.

07:06.750 --> 07:09.160
I'm going to have you study history.

07:09.160 --> 07:10.420
Huh?!

07:10.420 --> 07:14.660
H-History?!?!

07:15.410 --> 07:16.850
Shh!

07:18.400 --> 07:19.790
I'm sorry.

07:22.270 --> 07:24.020
The final round of the ranking tournament

07:24.020 --> 07:27.040
will take place in a Shadow World 
prepared by the academy.

07:27.490 --> 07:32.560
Historical incidents of various scales 
are recreated in those Worlds.

07:32.980 --> 07:38.150
If you are able to stop the incidents from 
happening, you clear the Shadow World.

07:38.150 --> 07:39.330
I see!

07:39.330 --> 07:42.120
If you have historical knowledge, 
it will help clear the Shadow World.

07:42.120 --> 07:44.110
You're so smart, Desir!

07:44.110 --> 07:48.700
But we don't know what incidents 
from which era will be reproduced, right?

07:48.700 --> 07:52.290
I picked certain events at random.

07:52.810 --> 07:55.780
At random? So we're using your intuition?

07:55.780 --> 07:57.760
What if you're totally off?

07:58.560 --> 08:00.210
That's a good question.

08:02.120 --> 08:03.270
I guess there's no way around it.

08:03.270 --> 08:06.210
Shall we study all of historical events?

08:06.210 --> 08:06.860
What?!

08:06.860 --> 08:09.170
I didn't want to burden you too much,

08:09.590 --> 08:12.350
but if Romantica is up for it, 
then I don't see why we can't.

08:13.420 --> 08:16.900
Let's read all the books on that bookshelf.

08:26.670 --> 08:28.230
<i>It's not my intuition.</i>

08:28.230 --> 08:32.740
<i>I know for a fact what the Shadow World 
for the final round is going to be.</i>

09:08.720 --> 09:10.230
Say, Pram...

09:10.640 --> 09:12.740
Y-Yes?

09:12.740 --> 09:14.960
What exactly are you looking at?

09:14.960 --> 09:15.910
Huh?!

09:20.510 --> 09:22.850
W-Was it obvious?

09:26.410 --> 09:27.920
So adorable.

09:29.420 --> 09:34.230
Listen, did you go shopping, 
just the two of you or something?

09:39.510 --> 09:42.230
Maybe grab something to eat together?

09:48.320 --> 09:52.550
Sharing a little secret just between 
the two of you, perhaps?

09:56.820 --> 10:00.250
Come on, tell me.

10:00.580 --> 10:02.510
Go on.

10:02.510 --> 10:03.580
Please stop!

10:03.580 --> 10:05.100
Fess up.

10:05.100 --> 10:07.800
Tell me what happened.

10:07.800 --> 10:10.060
N-N-Nothing happened!

10:10.060 --> 10:11.980
I don't believe you!

10:11.980 --> 10:13.730
Come on, show me your face.

10:13.730 --> 10:15.750
Please stop!

10:37.170 --> 10:39.630
Let's read the books, shall we?

10:40.960 --> 10:42.200
R-Right!

10:42.200 --> 10:43.910
We're sorry.

11:06.270 --> 11:10.470
Um... Uh...

11:13.050 --> 11:14.780
What do you want?

11:16.580 --> 11:18.030
It's been a while.

11:18.880 --> 11:20.710
Two months, maybe?

11:21.760 --> 11:23.920
I heard you joined Blue Moon.

11:23.920 --> 11:25.380
A wise choice.

11:25.930 --> 11:27.490
Why do you say that?

11:27.920 --> 11:31.150
You deserve to be in the 
strongest party in the academy.

11:32.520 --> 11:34.220
The strongest, huh?

11:34.980 --> 11:36.720
I wonder if that's true.

11:38.100 --> 11:41.690
Since you are here, Desir Herrman.

11:45.120 --> 11:46.490
I'll get down to business.

11:47.250 --> 11:48.560
I came here today—

11:48.560 --> 11:51.570
To declare war on me, right?

11:56.130 --> 11:58.830
Showing courtesy for someone 
you recognize as your rival...

11:58.830 --> 12:00.610
That's very much like you, Azest.

12:01.580 --> 12:04.560
You seem to know me quite well.

12:05.960 --> 12:09.230
I underestimated you on that day.

12:09.820 --> 12:11.210
I owe you an apology,

12:11.760 --> 12:14.190
but I won't lose to you again.

12:14.190 --> 12:16.820
I will defeat you with everything I have.

12:18.430 --> 12:19.840
<i>That's the spirit.</i>

12:20.270 --> 12:22.720
<i>Use me to get even stronger.</i>

12:24.200 --> 12:26.140
<i>I overextended myself 
to fight against you on that day,</i>

12:26.800 --> 12:29.190
<i>to ignite the fighting spirit in you.</i>

12:31.030 --> 12:32.920
<i>To change our future.</i>

12:33.500 --> 12:35.340
<i>Please continue to grow stronger.</i>

12:38.900 --> 12:44.730
<i>I'm looking forward to fighting 
alongside you, Azest Kingscrown.</i>

12:45.990 --> 12:51.710
The Day of the Ranking Tournament

13:25.470 --> 13:27.450
It's pretty noisy out there.

13:27.450 --> 13:30.370
The final round is a big event 
at the academy.

13:30.780 --> 13:33.120
A lot of townspeople come to watch.

13:33.120 --> 13:35.880
It's like a festival.

13:37.210 --> 13:40.320
I see you're wearing your tie properly today.

13:40.320 --> 13:42.630
Oh, yes, you are!

13:42.630 --> 13:45.220
It feels stifling, so I prefer not to.

13:45.880 --> 13:48.890
But I've got to go all-out today, you know?

13:48.890 --> 13:50.690
I see.

13:50.690 --> 13:54.500
I kind of assumed you were the type of boy 
who liked to show off your chest.

13:54.500 --> 13:58.110
That's some strange type of boy...

13:58.920 --> 14:02.860
W-We should go and find you a tie 
that doesn't feel stifling!

14:02.860 --> 14:04.360
I want to come, too!

14:04.360 --> 14:05.370
Huh?

14:05.370 --> 14:06.370
Huh?

14:06.370 --> 14:07.310
Huh?

14:07.620 --> 14:08.630
Huh?

14:09.880 --> 14:12.950
<i>They aren't even nervous.</i>

14:13.370 --> 14:15.330
<i>I guess that's for the best.</i>

14:17.260 --> 14:19.380
Well then, Romantica.

14:19.380 --> 14:20.380
Hm?

14:20.380 --> 14:21.540
Pram.

14:21.540 --> 14:22.630
Yes.

14:22.630 --> 14:24.380
Are you ready?

14:24.380 --> 14:25.070
I am.

14:25.070 --> 14:26.140
You bet!

14:26.930 --> 14:29.090
Then let's get going.

14:38.340 --> 14:39.320
Good luck!

14:39.320 --> 14:40.930
We have high hopes for you!

15:07.440 --> 15:09.590
So that's Desir?

15:09.590 --> 15:12.100
Doesn't seem like a big deal.

15:12.410 --> 15:14.240
Don't let your guard down.

15:14.240 --> 15:16.600
Remember what Professor Fergman told us?

15:17.530 --> 15:19.550
A guy like that isn't worth worrying about.

15:21.100 --> 15:22.840
<i>Thank you for waiting.</i>

15:23.340 --> 15:27.860
<i>We will begin the final round 
of the ranking tournament shortly.</i>

15:32.660 --> 15:38.230
<i>To clear the Shadow World, the participants 
must solve a certain incident.</i>

15:38.880 --> 15:42.070
So they won't tell us what incident.

15:42.070 --> 15:44.380
Finding it out is part of the deal.

15:45.080 --> 15:48.350
<i>In the Shadow World, you are 
allowed to use magic attacks,</i>

15:48.350 --> 15:51.890
<i>interference, and any other methods.</i>

15:52.550 --> 15:58.180
<i>If you receive fatal damage, 
you will be disqualified.</i>

16:00.650 --> 16:05.400
<i>Those who contribute to clearing 
the Shadow World will receive more points,</i>

16:06.040 --> 16:10.230
<i>and the top nine players will receive 
the title of single rankers.</i>

16:12.420 --> 16:14.530
We're at the very bottom.

16:14.870 --> 16:15.910
Yeah.

16:16.330 --> 16:20.920
To be single rankers, we have to 
either clear the Shadow World ourselves,

16:21.360 --> 16:23.710
or defeat every other participant here.

16:25.620 --> 16:28.260
<i>The gates are now opening.</i>

16:29.940 --> 16:33.960
<i>The final round of the ranking 
tournament begins now.</i>

17:41.820 --> 17:44.170
Finally, it's time.

17:44.170 --> 17:45.670
Let's do our best.

17:47.190 --> 17:48.480
Don't worry.

17:48.480 --> 17:50.040
We can do this.

17:51.360 --> 17:52.430
Yes!

17:53.160 --> 17:54.970
Shall we go, then?

18:29.330 --> 18:31.510
<i>Welcome to the Shadow World.</i>

18:31.510 --> 18:35.180
<i>Your location has been determined randomly.</i>

18:35.600 --> 18:39.200
<i>Good luck and do your best 
to clear the Shadow World.</i>

18:41.610 --> 18:43.730
First, I have to find those two.

18:52.240 --> 18:54.140
Icebolt, huh?

18:54.140 --> 18:56.490
Look how lucky I am.

18:57.630 --> 19:00.930
I found you right off the bat.

19:01.680 --> 19:03.910
I didn't know I was so famous.

19:03.910 --> 19:07.080
You are... infamous, that is!

19:07.830 --> 19:09.180
Ice blast!

19:09.830 --> 19:11.000
Fire road!

19:14.380 --> 19:16.340
<i>Two spells at the same time?</i>

19:16.730 --> 19:18.550
Aqua wave!

19:18.550 --> 19:20.030
Fire road!

19:24.730 --> 19:26.890
<i>The other spell is a defensive one.</i>

19:26.890 --> 19:27.900
<i>But why?</i>

19:40.650 --> 19:42.200
What an interesting idea.

19:42.200 --> 19:43.370
As expected from an alpha.

19:44.100 --> 19:46.130
I'm only just getting started.

19:59.090 --> 20:00.920
Amazing, huh?

20:00.920 --> 20:05.480
It's the type of magic a commoner like you 
would never be able to wield in your life.

20:06.190 --> 20:08.480
Any last words?

20:09.090 --> 20:10.920
That's the alpha class for you.

20:11.760 --> 20:15.110
But shouldn't you be aiming right here?

20:17.070 --> 20:20.030
Oh, I guess you don't have 
 fine control over your spell.

20:20.580 --> 20:22.370
Shut your mouth!

20:23.550 --> 20:24.910
Hit the nail on the head?

20:35.600 --> 20:38.050
How did you do that?

20:42.140 --> 20:43.870
Inversing spells?

20:44.280 --> 20:48.930
Never underestimate your opponent 
and always think about your next step.

20:48.930 --> 20:50.570
Those are the basics on the battlefield.

20:54.820 --> 20:58.070
Watch closely and ingrain it in your brain.

21:00.730 --> 21:06.630
There's no way a commoner's 
magic can beat me!

21:24.980 --> 21:27.290
Desir...!

21:34.230 --> 21:36.540
<i>One participant has been disqualified.</i>

21:36.540 --> 21:39.490
<i>There are 29 participants remaining.</i>

21:44.220 --> 21:45.630
<i>One down.</i>

21:46.740 --> 21:49.490
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:49.490 --> 21:52.200
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:52.200 --> 21:55.810
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:00.290 --> 22:05.700
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

22:05.700 --> 22:10.300
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairy tale</i>

22:11.050 --> 22:16.420
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

22:16.420 --> 22:20.850
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

22:21.200 --> 22:27.370
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

22:27.370 --> 22:32.630
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

22:32.630 --> 22:37.660
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

22:37.660 --> 22:41.870
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

22:43.380 --> 22:46.150
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:46.150 --> 22:48.840
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:48.840 --> 22:52.350
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:54.220 --> 22:57.060
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

22:57.060 --> 22:59.640
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

22:59.640 --> 23:02.350
<i>Because this time</i>

23:02.350 --> 23:06.480
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b></b>Episode 7

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b> Magical Beasts</b>

23:36.000 --> 23:38.750
Next episode, "Magical Beasts."
